            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Chemical reactions mein chemical bonds tootte bhi hain aur bante bhi hain. Jab do atoms ke darmiyan bond banta hai to energy bahar nikalti hai. Utni hi energy tab absorb hoti hai jab woh bond toot kar neutral atoms banata hai; ise bond dissociation energy kehte hain, jis ki definition yeh hai:"
