          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "tip",
            "title": "Table ko samjhein",
            "text": "Bond ki energy dekhne ke liye bayen column se ek atom aur oopar ki line se doosra atom (aur bond ki type) chunein. Misal: C atom aur 'O=' column milayen to C=O = 728 kJ mol⁻¹; N atom aur 'N≡' column se N≡N = 945 kJ mol⁻¹. Khali cell (khana) matlab table mein value nahi di gai."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Bond energy ko E se show karte hain. Agar hum kisi khaas substance mein kisi khaas bond ki energy maloom karein to use exact bond energy kehte hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Yaad rahe ke ek hi pair ke atoms ke darmiyan bond ki energy (B.E.) alag alag compounds mein aam taur par alag hoti hai, kyun ke molecule ke doosre atoms bhi B.E. par asar dalte hain. Misal: C–C bonds ki B.E. aam taur par taqreeban 350 se 380 kJ/mol hoti hai."
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\text{In ethane: } [\\ce{H3C-CH3}]\\ ;\\qquad E_{\\text{C-C}} = 376\\ \\text{kJ mol}^{-1}",
            "text_alt": "In ethane: [H₃C–CH₃] ; EC–C = 376 kJ mol⁻¹"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\text{In propane: } [\\ce{H3C-CH2-CH3}]\\ ;\\qquad E_{\\text{C-C}} = 356\\ \\text{kJ mol}^{-1}",
            "text_alt": "In propane: [H₃C–CH₂–CH₃] ; EC–C = 356 kJ mol⁻¹"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\text{In butane: } [\\ce{H3C-CH2-CH2-CH3}]\\ ;\\qquad E_{\\text{C-C}} = 352\\ \\text{kJ mol}^{-1}",
            "text_alt": "In butane: [H₃C–CH₂–CH₂–CH₃] ; EC–C = 352 kJ mol⁻¹"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "In misalon mein ethane ki Ec-c us ki exact bond energy hai; isi tarah propane aur butane ki Ec-c bhi un ki exact values hain. Jab hum alag alag molecules ki sab Ec-c ka average lete hain to average C–C bond energy milti hai. Practically (amli taur par) exact ki jagah average bond energy istemal hoti hai. Kuch bonds ki average bond energies Table 6.1 mein di gai hain."
          },
